`@State private var showImages = false`

![CleanShot 2024-09-09 at 21 29 40@2x](https://pub-1fd8ca6711bd4f3f8b74d88a697b50f9.r2.dev/2024-07-20-SwiftData/589817d4-6a25-4811-8a0b-8729955d054c.png)

