[이전글](https://haroldfromk.github.io/posts/Widget-(7)/){:target="_blank"} 참고.

### App Group 설정 및 권한 부여

![Image](https://pub-1fd8ca6711bd4f3f8b74d88a697b50f9.r2.dev/2025-06-04-Dex-11/5aadefaf-d45e-46ca-a484-b9e173ce905a.png)

