![CleanShot 2024-12-11 at 20 51 18](https://pub-1fd8ca6711bd4f3f8b74d88a697b50f9.r2.dev/2024-12-11-Widget-17/bbc2411e-15a8-4b66-af74-93c53a0a670f.png)

![CleanShot 2024-12-11 at 20 51 54](https://pub-1fd8ca6711bd4f3f8b74d88a697b50f9.r2.dev/2024-12-11-Widget-17/581037c4-ea5b-4ec0-86d8-a94a426ea057.png)

다시실행하면

