```text
RunWay.debug.dylib`@objc WatchConnectivityService.session(_:didReceiveUserInfo:):
    ...
    bl     0x1034066b0               ; symbol stub for: Swift._checkExpectedExecutor(...)
->  0x1032c1bb0 <+120>: ldr    x0, [sp, #0x20]
